{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1396653-2-questions","id":1396653,"title":"2 questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-15T05:32:45-07:00","id":1396653,"title":"2 questions","content":"A question about sympathetic casting, when casting sympathetically it states that a mage needs a yantra thats sympathetic to the target, what does that mean in game termes, <br /> <br /> say i wanted tocast a spell on a docter, would a hospital doctor coat be a link, maybe a weak one but still. <br /> <br /> <br /> 2nd question<br /> <br /> would someone explain how nimbus flair work , like im 5. \u2018<br /> <br /> thanks for your time <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6707-exkramental","name":"Exkramental","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T06:01:46-07:00","id":1396657,"title":"","content":"For the Sympathy casting. It something specific about the target. The closer...the more personal...the greater the link. For example, for a Dr, Alan coat could work. But a lab coat with his name on it is better. While a lock of his hair would be the best. I don't have my core book with me to give you the exact rules, sorry. <br /> <br /> As for the Nimbus, that's what I am working out myself. U started a thread hoping to get several examples of Nimbus. But so far, nothing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12207-mahjemm01","name":"Mahjemm01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T06:03:57-07:00","id":1396659,"title":"","content":"A coat from the same hospital, one where the doctor would have worked in a lot, would have a Weak sympathy. If it was the specific doctor's coat, it would be Medium sympathy. If it had a deep, emotional tie to the doctor (like if it was inherited from a highly respected mentor), then it would be Strong sympathy.<br /> <br /> For the Nimbus tilt, I believe this can be of aid:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://m45t1g05.blogspot.com/2016/07/mage-awakening-2nd-edition-nimbus-aura.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://m45t1g05.blogspot.com/2016/0...mbus-aura.html</a><br /> <br /> Hope that helps","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T06:32:30-07:00","id":1396664,"title":"","content":"I hate to say it but you're all wrong about Sympathetic casting. Sympathetic Range needs two things:<br /> 1.) It needs the <i>caster</i> to have a Sympathetic Connection to the subject. (This is often gained through casting Borrow Threads on an object that has a Sympathetic Connection to the intended subject.)<br /> 2.) It needs a Sympathetic Yantra, which is a specific type of Yantra category described in the book on page 122. In short, it needs to be something which directly symbolises the subject. Either a depiction of some kind, or a physical part of their body.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mahjemm01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1396653-2-questions?p=1396657#post1396657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the Sympathy casting. It something specific about the target. The closer...the more personal...the greater the link. For example, for a Dr, Alan coat could work. But a lab coat with his name on it is better. While a lock of his hair would be the best. I don't have my core book with me to give you the exact rules, sorry.</div> </div> </div> </div>When it comes to Sympathetic Range it doesn't matter how personal it is. A better Sympathetic Yantra would normally grant a higher dice bonus, but you don't get the dice bonus if you use it to cast at Sympathetic Range.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1396653-2-questions?p=1396659#post1396659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A coat from the same hospital, one where the doctor would have worked in a lot, would have a Weak sympathy. If it was the specific doctor's coat, it would be Medium sympathy. If it had a deep, emotional tie to the doctor (like if it was inherited from a highly respected mentor), then it would be Strong sympathy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Reduce the strength of the Sympathetic Connection for all examples by one step. Replaceable belongings (the personal coat) has a Weak Sympathy, and belongings with emotional significance (the inherited coat) has a Medium Sympathy. A random coat from the same hospital has no Sympathetic Connection to that doctor; especially not if he never uses it because he has a personal coat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T06:39:19-07:00","id":1396665,"title":"","content":"Glad to be corrected. I'm not that experienced with MtAw, and haven't studied Sympathic Magic in depth, mostly coz the group I play with hasn't actually tried to use any Sympathic Magic yet. There's so many options in game that a player can do that I am still in the process of absorbing all of it lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12207-mahjemm01","name":"Mahjemm01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T21:23:53-07:00","id":1396804,"title":"","content":"(Wrong thread, sorry.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"